    "evidence": "The production native JSON command surface accepts the TS declared object record, retaining its existing ignored surplus fields. This module-scope concrete decoder replaces the hidden local derive and refuses positional struct arrays. Finite raw JSON observations inspect actual native members and surplus keys; history bounds retain the existing omitted/explicit-null None semantics and numeric bits. Native_account_records dispatches through an actual registry TxFlow account before its existing venue refusal; native_account_methods proves real Binance Store removal over HTTP. This is a typed native JSON boundary, not source-side runtime validation.",
